<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - Labouchere ups Akzo to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - Labouchere ups Akzo to buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Nov 22 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Akzo Nobel    Chemicals	223.90   Bank Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (vs Hold). So far, 1996 has been characterised by rather disappointing figures. However, great effort has been made to change the settings. All in all, Akzo Nobel appears to have closed off a difficult period. With Pharma (pharmaceuticals) of increasing importance...we think the valuation of the share will be upgraded as evidence of Pharma's success will be put forward. We consider a P/E multiple expansion by two points possible. 12 month target NLG 270.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995		   18.48   (n/a)     12.1    7.00</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)	18.29   (18.29)   12.2    7.00</p>
<p>    1997		   20.73   (19.19)   10.8    8.00</p>
<p>    1998		   23.40   (n/a)	9.6    9.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
